1. Basic Port Discovery
nmap -Pn -p- -sT iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
2. Fast Port Discovery
nmap -Pn -p- -sT -T4 --min-rate 2000 iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
3. Service Enumeration
nmap -Pn -sT -sV iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
4. Default Scripts
nmap -Pn -sT -sV -sC iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
5. HTTP/HTTPS Information
nmap -Pn -sT --script=http-title,http-headers,http-server-header -p 80,443,8080,8443 iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
6. Web Enumeration
nmap -Pn -sT --script=http-enum,http-methods,http-robots.txt -p 80,443,8080,8443 iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
7. SSL/TLS Enumeration
nmap -Pn -sT --script=ssl-cert,ssl-enum-ciphers -p 443,8443 iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
8. Vulnerability Scripts
nmap -Pn -sT --script=vuln -p 80,443,8080,8443 iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
9. WAF and Security Headers
nmap -Pn -sT --script=http-waf-detect,http-cookie-flags,http-security-headers -p 80,443 iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
If Nmap Still Fails

Run:

nmap scanme.nmap.org

and

nmap --version

If even those fail, the Nmap installation itself is broken and you may need to use alternative tools such as:

nslookup iapp192644.croydon.ms.com
curl -I https://iapp192644.croydon.ms.com

or browser-based reconnaissance until Nmap is fixed.
